            0.336
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Now, try grouping the same organisms in more than one way. Each time change the criterion you are using for grouping (Table 12.2)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
